      "side": 1,
      "message": "We should do both and add the null check in handle show.\n\nRemoving the message to show isn\u0027t enough.  There\u0027s still the possibility that the system server will call show() after we decided to cancel the toast.  Of course the system server will then immediately call hide() but we didn\u0027t need to show the toast at all in the first place.\n\nSo use:\n\n    mTN.cancel();\n\nAnd in cancel() we should set mTM.mNextView to null.",
